    "Your headphones may be in use. Be sure to remove them from your ears before you continue.\n\nA loud sound will be played which could be uncomfortable for anyone who is wearing them.": {
      "comment": "Alert message before ringing the earbuds",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ca-ES": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "És possible que estiguis fent servir els auriculars. Assegura't de treure-te'ls abans de continuar.\n\nEs reproduirà un so fort que podria resultar incòmode per a qui els porti posats."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your headphones may be in use. Be sure to remove them from your ears before you continue.\n\nA loud sound will be played which could be uncomfortable for anyone who is wearing them."
          }
        },
        "es-ES": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es posible que tus auriculares estén en uso. Asegúrate de quitártelos antes de continuar.\n\nSe reproducirá un sonido alto que podría resultar incómodo para quien los lleve puestos."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
